    }
   ]
  },
  "c1": {
   "src": "L8395-8396",
   "text": "A magnificent joint feast wins over most of the audience, though a few refuse to eat.",
   "children": [
    {
     "next": "pp"
    }
   ]
  },
  "c2": {
   "src": "L8396-8398",
   "text": "A fermented experiment smells so appalling that BOTH communities evacuate the square together. Their first unanimous agreement: never cook that again.",
